# - cff-version 1.2.0 未定义 "status" 字段，但按归档要求保留了该行；严格的
#   CFF 校验器可能对其报警，可自行删除。

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite this repository and the associated manuscript."
title: "UnSegGNetSTD: Unsupervised Image Segmentation with Soft Threshold Dynamics Regularization"
type: software
status: "Manuscript under review (JMIV)"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Soft Threshold Dynamics (STD) regularization for
  unsupervised binary image segmentation. Images are represented as patch graphs
  built from pretrained DINO ViT features and optimized per image with either the
  standard GCN softmax or the STD-regularized softmax. This code accompanies a
  manuscript currently under review at the Journal of Mathematical Imaging and
  Vision (JMIV); reference quantitative results are reported in the manuscript.
